  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-WMC 206.01 Applicability. The rules in this part shall apply to any petition to amend, adopt, or repeal a rule submitted to the council pursuant to RSA 541-A:4.\n\nSource. #8031, eff 1-24-04",
